[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6019.43, "timestamp": "01:40:19", "text": "？  謝謝。哦，嗨，阿爾伯特。  歡迎來到直播間。哦，普通樣品。一切都亂了套。  巴特先生，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6030.229, "timestamp": "01:40:30", "text": "你這番話可真是爆炸性十足。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6040.149, "timestamp": "01:40:40", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6047.27, "timestamp": "01:40:47", "text": "對不起。我當時幾乎是尖叫著說的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6049.109, "timestamp": "01:40:49", "text": "。我的天啊。"}]